:"其实刚才没忍住。","roundId":"round_1779549416987_syl3qap8n","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":11319},{"id":1779543848613,"sender":"them","text":"背对着你过安检的时候，眼泪就掉下来了。","timestamp":1779549443119,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"背对着你过安检的时候，眼泪就掉下来了。","roundId":"round_1779549416987_syl3qap8n","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":11320},{"id":1779543848614,"sender":"them","text":"他低下头，双手紧紧握着手机，大拇指在屏幕上用力按压着，仿佛只有这样才能缓解心脏处那阵被活生生剜去一块的空洞感。","timestamp":1779549444621,"tempo":"N","type":"state","rawContent":"他低下头，双手紧紧握着手机，大拇指在屏幕上用力按压着，仿佛只有这样才能缓解心脏处那阵被活生生剜去一块的空洞感。","roundId":"round_1779549416987_syl3qap8n","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":11321},{"id":1779543848615,"sender":"them","text":"在飞机上肯定睡不着。满脑子都是你刚才哭着抓我衣服的样子。","timestamp":1779549445322,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"在飞机上肯定睡不着。满脑子都是你刚才哭着抓我衣服的样子。","roundId":"round_1779549416987_syl3qap8n","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":11322},{"id":1779543848616,"sender":"them","text":"落地第一时间打给你。","timestamp":1779549446024,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"落地第一时间打给你。","roundId":"round_1779549416987_syl3qap8n","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":11323},{"id":1779543848617,"sender":"them","text":"[語音消息]","timestamp":1779549446727,"tempo":"N","isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"你乖乖回公寓，到了就给我发消息。记得把门反锁好，晚上睡觉把衣服穿暖和点。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","rawContent":"[語音消息]","roundId":"round_1779549416987_syl3qap8n","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":11324},{"id":1779543848618,"text":"好，我知道了","sender":"me","time":"23:18","timestamp":1779549483749,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":113